TI  - Multimodal Imaging Detection of Difficult Mammary Paget Disease: Dermoscopy, Reflectance Confocal Microscopy, and Line-Field Confocal-Optical Coherence Tomography.
JO  - Diagnostics (Basel, Switzerland)
PY  - 2025
